Changes the appearance of Jesus
After six days, Jesus took Peter, James, and John, the brother of James, with him, and went up with them to a high mountain. They were all alone.
And his appearance had changed before them. His face was shining like the sun. His clothes became white like light.
At that moment, Moses and Elijah appeared before them in a glorious manifestation. Moses and Elijah were talking with Jesus.
Peter said to Jesus, "Our God, it is only fitting that we be here. If you wish, I will make three tabernacles for you: one for you, and one for Moses, and one for Elijah."
While Peter was speaking, a cloud of light appeared around them. And the voice from the cloud said, "This is my beloved Son, in whom I am well pleased. Listen to him!"
When the Muslims heard this, they trembled and fell down on their heads.
But Jesus came and stood in their midst. He said, "Peace be with you; do not be afraid."
